  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Impact Fund Denmark&#x2019;s Ukraine Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through deployment of risk willing capital to the private sector, the project will contribute to the stabilisation and recovery of the Ukrainian economy. The project will contribute to following key results;
&#x2022; Creating and retaining jobs with special attention to women and youth.
&#x2022; Support overall economic recovery and reconstruction of Ukraine.
&#x2022; Improved environmental, social and governance focus and processes for Ukrainian businesses.
&#x2022; Enhanced green growth in the areas where the investments are undertaken.
The project will extend the existing Ukraine Facility (UAF), which was established in 2023 after the outbreak of the Russian full-scale invasion of Ukraine.</narrative>
  </description>
